{"id":"12f957d86ed7612e","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-mm-unification-success-failure.md","title":"成功合一与自出现失败","display":"ex-mm-unification-success-failure — 成功合一与自出现失败","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-mm-unification-success-failure","aliases":["56-ex-mm-unification-success-failure"],"display":"ex-mm-unification-success-failure — 成功合一与自出现失败","depends_on":["[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]","[[56-df-mm-unification-step]]","[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]","[[56-thm-mm-unification-correctness]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Example 7.7.2(i); Table 7.9 rule (6)","source_printed_pages":"291–292","source_ocr_blocks":[312,313],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-mm-unification-success-failure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-mm-unification-success-failure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-mm-unification-success-failure — 成功合一与自出现失败"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ab7b6083e677200\" href=\"?note=6ab7b6083e677200\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-step\">56-df-mm-unification-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3c8230787b91c51f\" href=\"?note=3c8230787b91c51f\" title=\"56-thm-mm-unification-correctness\">56-thm-mm-unification-correctness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Example 7.7.2(i); Table 7.9 rule (6)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"291–292"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>312</span><span>313</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G,H\">\\(F,G,H\\)</span> 为互异函数符号，元数分别为2、1、2；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,u\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x,y,z,u\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 两两不同。签名包含这些符号。合一步骤、后缀答案及MGU见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6ab7b6083e677200\" href=\"?note=6ab7b6083e677200\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-step\">56-df-mm-unification-step</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3c8230787b91c51f\" href=\"?note=3c8230787b91c51f\" title=\"56-thm-mm-unification-correctness\">56-thm-mm-unification-correctness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_0\\coloneqq\\{(F(G(x),H(x,u)),F(z,H(F(y,y),z)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_0\\coloneqq\\{(F(G(x),H(x,u)),F(z,H(F(y,y),z)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_1\\coloneqq\\{(G(x),z),(H(x,u),H(F(y,y),z))\\},\\quad E_2\\coloneqq\\{(z,G(x)),(H(x,u),H(F(y,y),z))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_1\\coloneqq\\{(G(x),z),(H(x,u),H(F(y,y),z))\\},\\quad E_2\\coloneqq\\{(z,G(x)),(H(x,u),H(F(y,y),z))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_3\\coloneqq\\{(H(x,u),H(F(y,y),G(x)))\\},\\quad E_4\\coloneqq\\{(x,F(y,y)),(u,G(x))\\},\\quad E_5\\coloneqq\\{(u,G(F(y,y)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_3\\coloneqq\\{(H(x,u),H(F(y,y),G(x)))\\},\\quad E_4\\coloneqq\\{(x,F(y,y)),(u,G(x))\\},\\quad E_5\\coloneqq\\{(u,G(F(y,y)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_0\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_1\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_2\\xrightarrow{[z:=G(x)]}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_3\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_4\\xrightarrow{[x:=F(y,y)]}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_5\\xrightarrow{[u:=G(F(y,y))]}_{\\mathrm{MM}}\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_0\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_1\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_2\\xrightarrow{[z:=G(x)]}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_3\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_4\\xrightarrow{[x:=F(y,y)]}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_5\\xrightarrow{[u:=G(F(y,y))]}_{\\mathrm{MM}}\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\coloneqq[z:=G(x)]\\circ[x:=F(y,y)]\\circ[u:=G(F(y,y))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\coloneqq[z:=G(x)]\\circ[x:=F(y,y)]\\circ[u:=G(F(y,y))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a=\\{(z,G(F(y,y))),(x,F(y,y)),(u,G(F(y,y)))\\}\\cup\\{(v,v)\\mid v\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{z,x,u\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a=\\{(z,G(F(y,y))),(x,F(y,y)),(u,G(F(y,y)))\\}\\cup\\{(v,v)\\mid v\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{z,x,u\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Idempotent}(a)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Idempotent}(a)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(x,G(x))\\}\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}\\bot,\\qquad\\operatorname{Sol}(\\{(x,G(x))\\})=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(x,G(x))\\}\\xrightarrow{\\iota}_{\\mathrm{MM}}\\bot,\\qquad\\operatorname{Sol}(\\{(x,G(x))\\})=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成功部分逐步对应原书例7.7.2(i)，每个标签和后缀复合均显式保留；失败部分取自出现规则的最小单方程实例，由有限项不能等于自身真子项证明无解。有限实例只检验这些具体计算，一般正确性另由所引定理支撑。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","locat